<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Get In Touch — Craft with Brennan · SG Interior</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Get in touch with Brennan to talk about your interior design project. Residential and commercial in Singapore." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body>

  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="index.html" class="site-logo">Craft <span>with Brennan</span></a>
      <button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
      <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="work.html">My Work</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="active" aria-current="page">Get In Touch</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="section container">
      <div class="contact-block">
        <p class="eyebrow">Request a Consultation</p>
        <h1>Let's talk about your project.</h1>

        <p>Whether it's a home or a commercial space — if you care about the detail, fill in the form below. I read every one personally.</p>

        <p>If you have floor plans, a moodboard, or reference photos, you can share those after the first reply. I'll usually get back within a couple of working days.</p>

        <!--
          =====================================================================
          FORM SETUP
          ---------------------------------------------------------------------
          This form is wired for Formspree (free, simple, no backend required).

          To activate it:
            1. Sign up at https://formspree.io with your email
            2. Create a new form (call it "Brennan Site — Consultation Requests")
            3. Copy the form endpoint URL (looks like https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx)
            4. Replace YOUR_FORM_ID below with that ID
            5. Verify the email on Formspree's side — done.

          Free tier: 50 submissions/month.
          =====================================================================
        -->
        <form class="consult-form"
              action="https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID"
              method="POST"
              id="consultForm">

          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New consultation request — Brennan site" />
          <input type="hidden" name="_replyto" value="" id="replytoField" />

          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="name">Your name <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" />
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="email">Email <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="phone">Mobile / HP <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+65 ..." />
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="property">Project type <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <select id="property" name="property_type" required>
                <option value="">— Select —</option>
                <option value="HDB">HDB</option>
                <option value="BTO">BTO</option>
                <option value="EC">EC (Executive Condo)</option>
                <option value="Condo">Condo</option>
                <option value="Landed">Landed</option>
                <option value="Commercial">Commercial</option>
                <option value="Other">Other</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="message">Tell me about your project <span class="muted" style="font-weight:400; letter-spacing:0.1em;">(optional)</span></label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Style direction, key spaces, rough timeline, or anything else that would help me understand the project. Optional — but the more context you share, the more useful my first reply will be."></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="source">How did you hear about me?</label>
            <select id="source" name="source">
              <option value="">— Select —</option>
              <option value="Instagram">Instagram</option>
              <option value="TikTok">TikTok</option>
              <option value="Word of mouth / referral">Word of mouth / referral</option>
              <option value="Google search">Google search</option>
              <option value="Other">Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="form-actions">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-accent">Send Request →</button>
            <p class="privacy-note">Your details go straight to me. I don't share them and I don't run ads against your email.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="form-success" id="formSuccess">
            Thanks. I've got your message and will reply within 2 working days.
          </div>
        </form>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <h3>Find me on social</h3>
        <dl class="contact-list">
          <li>
            <dt>Instagram</dt>
            <dd><a href="https://www.instagram.com/brennan.sginterior" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@brennan.sginterior</a></dd>
          </li>
          <li>
            <dt>TikTok</dt>
            <dd><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@brennan.sginterior" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@brennan.sginterior</a></dd>
          </li>
        </dl>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <h3>Before you send — a few honest things</h3>
        <p>I work across residential and commercial. If you want a space that looks good on Day 1 and still holds up years later — that's what I do. If you're looking for something trend-driven or show-flat-styled, I'm probably not the right fit.</p>

        <p>I take on fewer projects at a time to keep the quality of attention where it needs to be. If I'm fully committed when you message, I'll let you know straight and give you a realistic timeline.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    (function() {
      var emailField = document.getElementById('email');
      var replytoField = document.getElementById('replytoField');
      if (emailField && replytoField) {
        emailField.addEventListener('input', function() {
          replytoField.value = emailField.value;
        });
      }
    })();
  </script>

